PRIMARY ACTIVE-SPARSITY POSITIVE

Once inactive audits stop earning free task reward:

FULL-FAMILY no longer dominates.

Best mean policy by primary cell:

RISK-AWARE:
16 of 25 cells.

LOCAL-ONLY:
3 of 25.

FIXED-5:
3 of 25.

FULL-FAMILY:
3 of 25.

FULL-FAMILY wins only:
high-activity / very-low-price cells.

It becomes strongly negative
under:
sparse activity
or:
high evidence price.

This resolves the H137 economic artifact.

